// REPRODUCED (semantics-v2-subtype-rules, ruling 2026-10-10), with one named
// residue. The final chapter number is `finalChapterNumber`, the chapter axis
// folded by `aggregate` [CR#714.2d]. RESIDUE: [CR#704.5s,714.4] also require
// that the Saga "isn't the source of a chapter ability that has triggered but
// not yet left the stack"; an ability waiting to be put on the stack
// [CR#704.3] has no spelling, so that clause is not written, as Siege's
// [CR#704.5v] is not. The entry counter applies only without read ahead
// [CR#714.3a]; the read-ahead entry [CR#714.3b] is a residue named on
// `readAhead`.
//
// The v1 core type-rule record this declaration carried until
// `plugins-v2-subtypes-macro-only`, preserved verbatim so nothing is lost:
//
//     body: Subtype(
//         name: "Saga",
//         types: [Enchantment],
//         confers: [
//             Ability(Static(Replacement(Also(
//                 would: ThisEnters,
//                 also: PutCounters(This, loreCounter, 1),
//             )))),
//             TurnBased(
//                 at: PrecombatMain,
//                 effect: PutCounters(This, loreCounter, 1),
//             ),
//             StateBased(
//                 condition: And([
//                     Compare(GreatestWatchedThreshold(This), AtLeast, 1),
//                     Compare(
//                         CounterCount(This, loreCounter),
//                         AtLeast,
//                         GreatestWatchedThreshold(This),
//                     ),
//                 ]),
//                 effect: sacrifice(You, This),
//             ),
//         ],
//     ),
//
// Saga ([CR#714]) — three conferrals of different kinds. [CR#714.3a]: a Saga
// "has the intrinsic ability 'This Saga enters with a lore counter on it'",
// which "creates a replacement effect" ([CR#614.1c]) — a REAL ability, so it
// occupies the ordinary Ability hierarchy. [CR#714.3c]: the precombat main
// phase lore counter is a turn-based action that "doesn't use the stack", so
// it is the ability-free `TurnBased` flavor. [CR#714.4]: the final-chapter
// sacrifice is a state-based action that "doesn't use the stack", so it is
// the ability-free `StateBased` flavor; its final chapter number is read off
// the card's own chapter abilities ([CR#714.2d]).
Subtype(
    category: Enchantment,
    name: "saga",
    spelling: "Saga",
    grammar: Noun(singular: "Saga"),
    params: [],
    rules: [
        Ability(static(
            onlyUnless(
                asEvent(enters(thisSaga), establish(entersWithCounters(thisSaga, 1, loreCounter))),
                matches(thisSaga, hasKeyword(The(readAhead))),
            ),
        )),
        TurnBased(precombatMainPhase, putCounters(1, loreCounter, thisSaga)),
        StateBased(
            and([
                compareAmt(finalChapterNumber(thisSaga), AtLeast, 1),
                compareAmt(countersOn(loreCounter, thisSaga), AtLeast, finalChapterNumber(thisSaga)),
            ]),
            sacrifice(thisSaga),
        ),
    ],
)
